366 0 obj
<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 219 0 R /Rect [ 59.694 126.647982 535.854004 745.367953 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure2) /TU (A flowchart depicting a fishery data workflow diagram, including the stages of Preparation, Implementation, Data Handling, and Assessment & Integration. The Preparation stage involves data collection and stakeholder identification. Implementation covers stakeholder meetings, data collection by fishers and traders, and literacy evaluations. Data Handling includes data extraction, coding, cleaning, and analysis. Assessment & Integration involves social-ecological assessments, stakeholder forums, and public awareness efforts. Key metrics include fishing efforts, catch-per-unit efforts, and individual income, integrated into community and neighborhood information.) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
